                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "I range the frozen tarn, and a ranger sees the whole open ice at once. You were in my sightline the instant you rounded the drift. An arrow gives fair warning - so do I. Stand and settle it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My Sneasel is faster than your second thoughts. Do not bring hesitation onto my ice."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The northern watch keeps a portrait behind glass, and the glass is thin over your face. I will not name it. My bow will point at whatever you truly are."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Brynja Frostarrow",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
